1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:09,967
Speaking, task two. Card number 11. You are at a car repair shop. You need your car repaired. Ask four questions.

2
00:00:10,667 --> 00:00:14,275
You are at a car repair shop. You need your car repaired.

3
00:00:15,467 --> 00:00:17,961
Hello. What can I do for you?

4
00:00:23,167 --> 00:00:25,500
Hello, when will the car be ready?

5
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:27,533
The car will be ready on Friday.

6
00:00:32,733 --> 00:00:34,367
How much will the repair cost?

7
00:00:34,567 --> 00:00:36,855
The repair will cost about 6,000 crowns.

8
00:00:42,067 --> 00:00:43,855
Can you lend me a replacement car?

9
00:00:44,067 --> 00:00:46,223
Yes, we can lend you a replacement car.

10
00:00:51,433 --> 00:00:53,054
Can I pay by card?

11
00:00:53,267 --> 00:00:55,485
Yes, you can pay by card or in cash.

12
00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:58,700
Thank you for the information. Goodbye.

13
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:00,052
Goodbye.

14
00:01:00,267 --> 00:01:08,962
Practise card 11 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
